0e92d89/uploads/origins/8e549447-614b-4e4a-9d53-dbe720af8012?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=566a55d758a55349136643e8fb73db8f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/20e92d89/uploads/origins/8e549447-614b-4e4a-9d53-dbe720af8012?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f96f0118a447218ef594aab4e6805943 3x"}, "body": "Mr. Marmori, it is nice to meet you. I saw your illustration and it was very nice, so I would like to make a request.\nI would like you to draw my OC, Abi, if you don't mind.\n\n\nPlease send me your reference ↓.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-WyVFPNGhRQLGJBvS80gHq2bQTpEJmEB\nPlease refer to the \"Abi\" folder in this one.\n\nReal name is Kaneko (Kaneko) Abi. 16 years old, freshman in high school.\nA girl who thinks the world is rotten. She has a cat-like personality.\nShe has pierced ears and tongue. She is free to get more piercings!\nIn junior high school, she was a dull black-haired mechakure, but when she saw subculture fashion, she got scared and changed her hair to patskin to make her high school debut as well.\nShe is good at sewing.\n\n\nPlease cancel if you are too busy.\nThank you for your consideration.", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@strmrmr1/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1790155, "client_id": 1395765, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/998c9754/uploads/origins/e604ba09-fb4f-41ea-a21c-73ed7bbfee9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0518c83d0c8dfb335c66ca9276e65199", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/998c9754/uploads/origins/e604ba09-fb4f-41ea-a21c-73ed7bbfee9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0518c83d0c8dfb335c66ca9276e65199, https://si.imgix.net/998c9754/uploads/origins/e604ba09-fb4f